---
---
<section id="proces" class="px-6 py-16 lg:px-14 lg:py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center">
    <div class="order-2 lg:order-1">
      <div class="process-widget reveal relative mx-auto max-w-md rounded-[2rem] bg-[#eef1ed] p-8 shadow-card">
        <div class="process-badge absolute -left-6 top-10 hidden rounded-full bg-limebrand px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-geo-900 md:block">teren</div>
        <div class="process-badge absolute -right-6 bottom-16 hidden rounded-full bg-geo-900 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-white md:block">dokumentacja</div>
        <div class="rounded-[1.5rem] bg-white p-5 shadow-card">
          <div class="mb-5 flex items-center justify-between">
            <div>
              <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-black/42">Status zlecenia</p>
              <h3 class="mt-1 text-xl font-semibold">Mapa do projektu</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="rounded-full bg-limebrand px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-geo-900">w toku</span>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#f7f7f3] p-4">
              <div class="flex justify-between text-sm"><span>Ustalenie zakresu</span><span>100%</span></div>
              <div class="mt-3 h-2 rounded-full bg-black/5"><div class="status-fill status-100 h-2 rounded-full bg-geo-700"></div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#f7f7f3] p-4">
              <div class="flex justify-between text-sm"><span>Pomiar w terenie</span><span>75%</span></div>
              <div class="mt-3 h-2 rounded-full bg-black/5"><div class="status-fill status-75 h-2 rounded-full bg-limebrand"></div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#f7f7f3] p-4">
              <div class="flex justify-between text-sm"><span>Opracowanie mapy</span><span>następny krok</span></div>
              <div class="mt-3 h-2 rounded-full bg-black/5"><div class="status-fill status-24 h-2 rounded-full bg-black/20"></div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="order-1 lg:order-2">
      <div class="reveal">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.24em] text-geo-600">Proces</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.04em] md:text-5xl">Wiesz, co trzeba przygotować i co wydarzy się dalej.</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-xl leading-7 text-black/58">Komunikacja na stronie jest spokojna, prosta i zadaniowa.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="reveal rounded-[1.4rem] bg-white p-6 shadow-card">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-geo-700">01</p>
          <h3 class="mt-3 font-semibold">Krótka konsultacja</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-black/55">Ustalenie rodzaju sprawy i lokalizacji działki.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal rounded-[1.4rem] bg-white p-6 shadow-card">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-geo-700">02</p>
          <h3 class="mt-3 font-semibold">Termin i pomiar</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-black/55">Prace terenowe zgodnie z ustalonym zakresem.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal rounded-[1.4rem] bg-white p-6 shadow-card">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-geo-700">03</p>
          <h3 class="mt-3 font-semibold">Opracowanie</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-black/55">Przygotowanie map, szkiców i dokumentacji.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal rounded-[1.4rem] bg-limebrand p-6 shadow-card">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-geo-900">04</p>
          <h3 class="mt-3 font-semibold">Przekazanie materiałów</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-geo-900/68">Finalne dokumenty trafiają do klienta.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
